# ~/.local/share/fedokawai/wallpapers.list — the wallpaper pack: pictures fetched from
# GitHub (pinned commits, checked by sha256) and redrawn by `kawa-wallpaper --pack` as
# 640×360 pixel art with 32 colours; on screen each pixel is enlarged by a whole number,
# so it stays a crisp square. Each belongs to the dark or the light theme; "pair" names
# the same place in the other theme's light, and choosing one sets both.
# Nothing here is stored in the repository: the files are downloaded for your own use.
#
# Grouped by kind; the picker lists them in this order, the theme's default first.
#
# mode  name                 pair                 sha256  url  credit (licence)

